<title>USA: Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn unit in data agreement.</title>
<headline>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn unit in data agreement.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenstone Healthcare Solutions, a disease management subsidiary of Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn, signed an agreement with the Hope Cancer Care Network of Chicago to integrate oncology patient data, Greenstone said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The agreement covers integration of data for an estimated 4,000 cancer patients.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
